---
source: crates/observed_macros_impl/tests/expansion.rs
expression: output
---
---- input ----
#[event("e")]
1 + 1

---- yields ----
expected `struct`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
1 + 1

---- yields ----
expected one of: `struct`, `enum`, `union`

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
enum NotAStruct { A }

---- yields ----
expected `struct`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
enum NotAStruct { A }

---- yields ----
Enrichment can only be derived for structs, not enums

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
fn not_a_struct() {}

---- yields ----
expected `struct`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
fn not_a_struct() {}

---- yields ----
expected one of: `struct`, `enum`, `union`
